# FROM names a project. Each host maps it to its own checkout, and only hosts that have it are eligible.
FROM myapp

# One PROMPT is one harness session. Stages run in order; a failed stage ends the job.
HARNESS claude --model opus
PROMPT "/goal run a lane to implement #1234"

HARNESS codex
PROMPT <<END
Review the branch for #1234 against main.
Report done if it is ready to merge, fail with the blocking finding if not.
END
